<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-10> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A10:F10; source type=resource; description=hydrochloric acid, 30% in H2O, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.000628698224852071 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 10; source type: resource; original description: hydrochloric acid, 30% in H2O, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.000628698224852071; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-11> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A11:F11; source type=resource; description=hydrogen fluoride, at plant; location=GLO; amount=0.0006451347797501643 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No sufficiently justified compatible provider has been selected; source record is retained for later mapping. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | hydrogen fluoride, at plant [GLO]. One kg of source HF demand uses one kg of the German chemicals-nec sector as a broad composition/production proxy for the original global source. Not an exact HF dataset. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 11; source type: resource; original description: hydrogen fluoride, at plant; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.0006451347797501643; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-12> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A12:F12; source type=resource; description=sodium hydroxide, 50% in H2O, production mix, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.604043392504931 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 12; source type: resource; original description: sodium hydroxide, 50% in H2O, production mix, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.604043392504931; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-13> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A13:F13; source type=resource; description=lime, hydrated, packed, at plant; location=CH; amount=0.01508053911900066 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_CMNT; Same source geography. Broad cement/lime/plaster sector proxy; hydrated-lime and packaging details are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 13; source type: resource; original description: lime, hydrated, packed, at plant; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.01508053911900066; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
