<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-17> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A17:F17; source type=resource; description=tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user; location=CN; amount=170.940170940171 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user [CN]. Assume 1000 kg/m3 and EUR 2/m3 for tap-water supply, giving EUR 0.002/kg. Use the German monetary water sector as a geographic proxy for Chinese supply because the Chinese offering has no published provider URI. This price is an illustrative scenario coefficient. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 17; source type: resource; original description: tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user; original geography: CN; original quantity: 170.940170940171; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
