<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-19> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A19:F19; source type=resource; description=natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; location=RER; amount=0.06081525312294543 MJ; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI EF_GASE; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Natural-gas combustion proxy in energy units; furnace efficiency and low-NOx technology are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 19; source type: resource; original description: natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.06081525312294543; original unit: MJ; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-2> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A2:F2; source type=product; description=photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant; location=CN; amount=1 m2; SD95=not supplied. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 2; source type: product; original description: photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant; original geography: CN; original quantity: 1; original unit: m2; mapping status: reference output." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-20> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A20:F20; source type=resource; description=photovoltaic cell factory; location=DE; amount=3.99819197896121e-7 unit; SD95=3.052465021652124. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | photovoltaic cell factory [DE]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. Not a measured factory cost or equipment inventory. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 20; source type: resource; original description: photovoltaic cell factory; original geography: DE; original quantity: 3.99819197896121e-7; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.052465021652124; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-21> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A21:F21; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=0.2740795529257067 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 21; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.2740795529257067; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-22> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A22:F22; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, rail; location=RER; amount=1.520381328073636 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, rail [RER]. Assume EUR 0.03 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. This is not a rail-specific physical dataset. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 22; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, rail; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1.520381328073636; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-23> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A23:F23; source type=resource; description=treatment, PV cell production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 3; location=CH; amount=0.1538461538461539 m3; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The source is a volume-based effluent service; BONSAI uses mass service units. Effluent density and an agreed service match are missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | treatment, PV cell production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 3 [CH]. Assume effluent density 1000 kg/m3 and represent the treatment using the Swiss sewage-service sector. The PV chemical-effluent composition and class-3 technology are not represented by this proxy. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 23; source type: resource; original description: treatment, PV cell production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 3; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.1538461538461539; original unit: m3; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-24> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A24:F24; source type=resource; description=disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill; location=CH; amount=2.329881656804734 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill [CH]. Assume residual inorganic wafer waste is non-hazardous inert waste and use Swiss construction-waste landfill as a broad treatment proxy. Retain full wet mass; no drying or moisture adjustment. Waste classification must be confirmed for a real assessment. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 24; source type: resource; original description: disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill; original geography: CH; original quantity: 2.329881656804734; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-25> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A25:F25; source type=resource; description=disposal, solvents mixture, 16.5% water, to hazardous waste incineration; location=CH; amount=0.172172912557528 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, solvents mixture, 16.5% water, to hazardous waste incineration [CH]. Assume Swiss hazardous-waste incineration with energy recovery. Recovery is a scenario assumption because the source label does not specify it; retain full wet mass. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 25; source type: resource; original description: disposal, solvents mixture, 16.5% water, to hazardous waste incineration; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.172172912557528; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
