<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cell-cn-4> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cell - CN!A4:F4; source type=resource; description=metallization paste, front side, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.003373015873015874 kg; SD95=1.090674403215233. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: Paste composition is not supplied. A precious-metal or aluminium mass fraction must be confirmed before selecting a material proxy. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | metallization paste, front side, at plant [RER]. Assume 85% silver/precious-metal mass and 15% chemical binder. German precious-metals and chemicals sectors are proxies, not paste-specific datasets or measured composition. Fractions sum to one kg per kg paste. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cell - CN; row: 4; source type: resource; original description: metallization paste, front side, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.003373015873015874; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.090674403215233; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
