<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-10> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A10:F10; source type=resource; description=electricity, medium voltage, at grid; location=CN; amount=32 kWh; SD95=1.216766586708428. Quantity conversion: 1 kWh = 3.6 MJ. BONSAI M_electricity; Same source geography. National aggregate electricity market; voltage and grid-specific losses are not distinguished. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 10; source type: resource; original description: electricity, medium voltage, at grid; original geography: CN; original quantity: 32; original unit: kWh; SD95: 1.216766586708428; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-11> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A11:F11; source type=resource; description=natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; location=RER; amount=68.22429906542055 MJ; SD95=1.322292297244009. BONSAI EF_GASE; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Natural-gas combustion proxy in energy units; furnace efficiency and low-NOx technology are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 11; source type: resource; original description: natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; original geography: RER; original quantity: 68.22429906542055; original unit: MJ; SD95: 1.322292297244009; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-12> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A12:F12; source type=resource; description=water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant; location=CN; amount=4.01 kg; SD95=1.322292297244009. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant [CN]. Assume 1000 kg water/m3, EUR 2/m3 for water supply and 0.005 MJ electricity/kg for deionisation. Thus 1 kg requires EUR 0.002 water service and 0.005 MJ electricity. The German monetary water sector is a geographic proxy for Chinese water because the Chinese offering has no published provider URI; Chinese electricity is used. Resins, chemicals and treatment infrastructure are not separately modelled. These are illustrative coefficients, not plant data. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 12; source type: resource; original description: water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant; original geography: CN; original quantity: 4.01; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.322292297244009; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-13> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A13:F13; source type=direct emission; description=Water, cooling, unspecified natural origin, CN; location=resource, in water; amount=5.09 m3; SD95=1.322292297244009. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 13; source type: direct emission; original description: Water, cooling, unspecified natural origin, CN; original geography: resource, in water; original quantity: 5.09; original unit: m3; SD95: 1.322292297244009; mapping status: elementary flow retained." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-14> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A14:F14; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=1.13075 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 14; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1.13075; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-15> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A15:F15; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, rail; location=RER; amount=1.41 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, rail [RER]. Assume EUR 0.03 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. This is not a rail-specific physical dataset. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 15; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, rail; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1.41; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-16> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A16:F16; source type=resource; description=silicone plant; location=RER; amount=1e-11 unit; SD95=3.094703007033971. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | silicone plant [RER]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. This is an arbitrary demonstration coefficient, not a measured plant cost; equipment and plant-specific construction are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 16; source type: resource; original description: silicone plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1e-11; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.094703007033971; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-17> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A17:F17; source type=resource; description=disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill; location=CH; amount=0.167 kg; SD95=1.322292297244009. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill [CH]. Assume residual inorganic wafer waste is non-hazardous inert waste and use Swiss construction-waste landfill as a broad treatment proxy. Retain full wet mass; no drying or moisture adjustment. Waste classification must be confirmed for a real assessment. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 17; source type: resource; original description: disposal, waste, Si waferprod., inorg, 9.4% water, to residual material landfill; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.167; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.322292297244009; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-18> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A18:F18; source type=resource; description=treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2; location=CH; amount=4.839109 m3; SD95=1.62553462388069. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The source is a volume-based effluent service; BONSAI uses mass service units. Effluent density and an agreed service match are missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2 [CH]. Assume effluent density 1000 kg/m3. One m3 requires treatment of 1000 kg in the Swiss sewage-service sector. Source treatment class and effluent composition are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 18; source type: resource; original description: treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2; original geography: CH; original quantity: 4.839109; original unit: m3; SD95: 1.62553462388069; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
