<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-4> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A4:F4; source type=resource; description=argon, liquid, at plant; location=RER; amount=1 kg; SD95=1.322292297244009. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 4; source type: resource; original description: argon, liquid, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.322292297244009; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-cz-si-cn-5> dcterms:description "Excel X-Cz-Si - CN!A5:F5; source type=resource; description=hydrogen fluoride, at plant; location=GLO; amount=0.01 kg; SD95=1.651727352553859. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No sufficiently justified compatible provider has been selected; source record is retained for later mapping. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | hydrogen fluoride, at plant [GLO]. One kg of source HF demand uses one kg of the German chemicals-nec sector as a broad composition/production proxy for the original global source. Not an exact HF dataset. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Cz-Si - CN; row: 5; source type: resource; original description: hydrogen fluoride, at plant; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.01; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.651727352553859; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
