<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-apac-12> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - APAC!A12:F12; source type=resource; description=silicone plant; location=RER; amount=1e-11 unit; SD95=3.094703007033971. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | silicone plant [RER]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. This is an arbitrary demonstration coefficient, not a measured plant cost; equipment and plant-specific construction are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - APAC; row: 12; source type: resource; original description: silicone plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1e-11; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.094703007033971; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-apac-13> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - APAC!A13:F13; source type=resource; description=transport, transoceanic freight ship; location=OCE; amount=2.55 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, transoceanic freight ship [OCE]. Assume EUR 0.01 per t.km, expressed in the BONSAI monetary water-transport service. The global sector is a broad ocean-freight proxy. This price is an illustrative scenario value, not a current freight quote. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - APAC; row: 13; source type: resource; original description: transport, transoceanic freight ship; original geography: OCE; original quantity: 2.55; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-apac-14> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - APAC!A14:F14; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=0.1559869879518073 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - APAC; row: 14; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.1559869879518073; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
