<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-no-5> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - NO!A5:F5; source type=resource; description=hard coal coke, at plant; location=RER; amount=23.12 MJ; SD95=1.223759340594706. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The source is fuel supply expressed by energy content; conversion to mass requires a verified heating value. Selecting a combustion dataset would change the process boundary. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | hard coal coke, at plant [RER]. Assume 28 MJ/kg coke energy content, supplied as material. Do not add combustion burdens here; source direct emissions remain separate. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - NO; row: 5; source type: resource; original description: hard coal coke, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 23.12; original unit: MJ; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-no-6> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - NO!A6:F6; source type=resource; description=graphite, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.1 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - NO; row: 6; source type: resource; original description: graphite, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.1; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-no-7> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - NO!A7:F7; source type=resource; description=charcoal, at plant; location=GLO; amount=0.17 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_CHAR; Same source geography. Charcoal market; original feedstock and production technology are not specified by this market. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - NO; row: 7; source type: resource; original description: charcoal, at plant; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.17; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-no-8> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - NO!A8:F8; source type=resource; description=petroleum coke, at refinery; location=RER; amount=0.5 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_PETC; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Petroleum-coke market. This is material supply, not coke combustion. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - NO; row: 8; source type: resource; original description: petroleum coke, at refinery; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.5; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-no-9> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - NO!A9:F9; source type=resource; description=silica sand, at plant; location=DE; amount=2.7 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_SDCL; Same source geography. Broad sand-and-clay sector proxy; silica purity is not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - NO; row: 9; source type: resource; original description: silica sand, at plant; original geography: DE; original quantity: 2.7; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
