<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-mg-si-us-4> dcterms:description "Excel X-MG-Si - US!A4:F4; source type=resource; description=wood chips, production mix, wet, measured as dry mass, at forest road & at sawmill; location=RER; amount=0.003253012048192771 kg; SD95=1.223759340594706. BONSAI M_WOOD; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad wood-products proxy; original dry-mass quantity is retained. Moisture specification is not represented by this sector. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-MG-Si - US; row: 4; source type: resource; original description: wood chips, production mix, wet, measured as dry mass, at forest road & at sawmill; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.003253012048192771; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.223759340594706; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
