<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-10> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A10:F10; source type=resource; description=lead, at regional storage; location=RER; amount=0.000725 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_LZTP; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad lead/zinc/tin sector proxy; individual metal purity and production route are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 10; source type: resource; original description: lead, at regional storage; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.000725; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-11> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A11:F11; source type=resource; description=solar glass, low-iron, at regional storage; location=RER; amount=8.8125 kg; SD95=1.328581270586227. BONSAI M_GLAS_01_RES; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad glass-products sector proxy; low-iron specification and glass manufacturing route are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 11; source type: resource; original description: solar glass, low-iron, at regional storage; original geography: RER; original quantity: 8.8125; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.328581270586227; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-12> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A12:F12; source type=resource; description=tempering, flat glass; location=RER; amount=8.8125 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: A mass-based processing-only provider is missing. Substituting the material market would double-count material supply. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | tempering, flat glass [RER]. Energy-only service proxy: assume 1 MJ industrial heat per kg glass tempering using the German non-metallic-minerals heat sector. Original glass supply is counted separately and is not added again. This is a demonstration energy coefficient, not a measured tempering inventory. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 12; source type: resource; original description: tempering, flat glass; original geography: RER; original quantity: 8.8125; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-13> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A13:F13; source type=resource; description=glass fibre reinforced plastic, polyamide, injection moulding, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.295 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_RUBP_01_RES; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad finished plastic/rubber-products proxy; silicone chemistry or glass-fibre fraction and moulding are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 13; source type: resource; original description: glass fibre reinforced plastic, polyamide, injection moulding, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.295; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
