<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-16> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A16:F16; source type=resource; description=ethylvinylacetate, foil, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.8749999999999999 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_FOIL_PLA; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad plastic-foil sector proxy; polymer identity and fluorinated-material chemistry are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 16; source type: resource; original description: ethylvinylacetate, foil, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.8749999999999999; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-17> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A17:F17; source type=resource; description=polyvinylfluoride film, at plant; location=US; amount=0.111875 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_FOIL_PLA; Same source geography. Broad plastic-foil sector proxy; polymer identity and fluorinated-material chemistry are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 17; source type: resource; original description: polyvinylfluoride film, at plant; original geography: US; original quantity: 0.111875; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-18> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A18:F18; source type=resource; description=tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user; location=CN; amount=5.03125 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user [CN]. Assume 1000 kg/m3 and EUR 2/m3 for tap-water supply, giving EUR 0.002/kg. Use the German monetary water sector as a geographic proxy for Chinese supply because the Chinese offering has no published provider URI. This price is an illustrative scenario coefficient. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 18; source type: resource; original description: tap water, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at user; original geography: CN; original quantity: 5.03125; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-19> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A19:F19; source type=resource; description=hydrogen fluoride, at plant; location=GLO; amount=0.062375 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No sufficiently justified compatible provider has been selected; source record is retained for later mapping. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | hydrogen fluoride, at plant [GLO]. One kg of source HF demand uses one kg of the German chemicals-nec sector as a broad composition/production proxy for the original global source. Not an exact HF dataset. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 19; source type: resource; original description: hydrogen fluoride, at plant; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.062375; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-2> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A2:F2; source type=product; description=photovoltaic panel, single-Si, at plant; location=CN; amount=1 m2; SD95=not supplied. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 2; source type: product; original description: photovoltaic panel, single-Si, at plant; original geography: CN; original quantity: 1; original unit: m2; mapping status: reference output." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-20> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A20:F20; source type=resource; description=1-propanol, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.015875 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 20; source type: resource; original description: 1-propanol, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.015875; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-21> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A21:F21; source type=resource; description=isopropanol, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.000146875 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 21; source type: resource; original description: isopropanol, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.000146875; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-22> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A22:F22; source type=resource; description=potassium hydroxide, at regional storage; location=RER; amount=0.0514375 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 22; source type: resource; original description: potassium hydroxide, at regional storage; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.0514375; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-23> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A23:F23; source type=resource; description=soap, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.0115625 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 23; source type: resource; original description: soap, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.0115625; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-24> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A24:F24; source type=resource; description=corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.7625 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_PAPE_01_RES; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad paper-products sector proxy; corrugation and recycled-fibre share are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 24; source type: resource; original description: corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.7625; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-25> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A25:F25; source type=resource; description=EUR-flat pallet; location=RER; amount=0.05 unit; SD95=1.34403163730924. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | EUR-flat pallet [RER]. Assume 25 kg wood per pallet-equivalent, supplied by the German wood-products sector. This mass is a demonstration assumption, not the measured source pallet mass. It is packaging, not retained panel material. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 25; source type: resource; original description: EUR-flat pallet; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.05; original unit: unit; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-26> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A26:F26; source type=resource; description=electricity, medium voltage, at grid; location=CN; amount=13.97542485937369 kWh; SD95=1.090674403215233. Quantity conversion: 1 kWh = 3.6 MJ. BONSAI M_electricity; Same source geography. National aggregate electricity market; voltage and grid-specific losses are not distinguished. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 26; source type: resource; original description: electricity, medium voltage, at grid; original geography: CN; original quantity: 13.97542485937369; original unit: kWh; SD95: 1.090674403215233; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-27> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A27:F27; source type=resource; description=diesel, burned in building machine, average; location=CH; amount=0.008749999999999999 MJ; SD95=2.121226291675423. BONSAI EF_DOIL; Same source geography. Diesel-combustion proxy in energy units; machinery-specific operation is not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 27; source type: resource; original description: diesel, burned in building machine, average; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.008749999999999999; original unit: MJ; SD95: 2.121226291675423; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-28> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A28:F28; source type=resource; description=photovoltaic panel factory; location=GLO; amount=0.000004 unit; SD95=3.061634597973428. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | photovoltaic panel factory [GLO]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. Not a measured factory cost or equipment inventory. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 28; source type: resource; original description: photovoltaic panel factory; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.000004; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.061634597973428; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-29> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A29:F29; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=2.773927875 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 29; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 2.773927875; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-3> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A3:F3; source type=component; description=photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant; location=CN; amount=0.935415 m2; SD95=1.243456651079923. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 3; source type: component; original description: photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant; original geography: CN; original quantity: 0.935415; original unit: m2; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: internal supplier connection. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-30> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A30:F30; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, rail; location=RER; amount=16.637810625 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, rail [RER]. Assume EUR 0.03 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. This is not a rail-specific physical dataset. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 30; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, rail; original geography: RER; original quantity: 16.637810625; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-31> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A31:F31; source type=resource; description=disposal, municipal solid waste, 22.9% water, to municipal incineration; location=CH; amount=0.03 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, municipal solid waste, 22.9% water, to municipal incineration [CH]. Assume unsorted-waste incineration with energy recovery, using the German sector as a geographic proxy for Switzerland because no Swiss offering with a published provider URI is available. Recovery is a scenario assumption, not specified by the source label. Full wet mass is retained. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 31; source type: resource; original description: disposal, municipal solid waste, 22.9% water, to municipal incineration; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.03; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-32> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A32:F32; source type=resource; description=disposal, polyvinylfluoride, 0.2% water, to municipal incineration; location=CH; amount=0.00429375 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, polyvinylfluoride, 0.2% water, to municipal incineration [CH]. Assume Swiss plastic/rubber incineration with energy recovery as a broad PVF treatment proxy. Fluorine-specific emissions and source moisture composition are not resolved. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 32; source type: resource; original description: disposal, polyvinylfluoride, 0.2% water, to municipal incineration; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.00429375; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-33> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A33:F33; source type=resource; description=disposal, plastics, mixture, 15.3% water, to municipal incineration; location=CH; amount=0.0280625 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, plastics, mixture, 15.3% water, to municipal incineration [CH]. Assume Swiss plastic/rubber incineration with energy recovery. Recovery and treatment technology are scenario assumptions; full wet mass is retained. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 33; source type: resource; original description: disposal, plastics, mixture, 15.3% water, to municipal incineration; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.0280625; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-34> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A34:F34; source type=resource; description=disposal, used mineral oil, 10% water, to hazardous waste incineration; location=CH; amount=0.00160625 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, used mineral oil, 10% water, to hazardous waste incineration [CH]. Assume Swiss hazardous-waste incineration with energy recovery. Recovery and treatment technology are scenario assumptions; full wet mass is retained. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 34; source type: resource; original description: disposal, used mineral oil, 10% water, to hazardous waste incineration; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.00160625; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-35> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A35:F35; source type=resource; description=treatment, sewage, from residence, to wastewater treatment, class 2; location=CH; amount=0.004528125 m3; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The source is a volume-based effluent service; BONSAI uses mass service units. Effluent density and an agreed service match are missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | treatment, sewage, from residence, to wastewater treatment, class 2 [CH]. Assume effluent density 1000 kg/m3 and use the Swiss residential-wastewater treatment sector. Source treatment-class details are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 35; source type: resource; original description: treatment, sewage, from residence, to wastewater treatment, class 2; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.004528125; original unit: m3; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
