<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-4> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A4:F4; source type=resource; description=aluminium alloy, AlMg3, at plant; location=RER; amount=2.125 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_ALUM_01_RES; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad aluminium-products sector proxy; AlMg3 composition and recycled content are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 4; source type: resource; original description: aluminium alloy, AlMg3, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 2.125; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-5> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A5:F5; source type=resource; description=copper, at regional storage; location=RER; amount=0.1025 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_COPP; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Copper-products market; source inventory quantity is retained. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 5; source type: resource; original description: copper, at regional storage; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.1025; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-6> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A6:F6; source type=resource; description=wire drawing, copper; location=RER; amount=0.1025 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: A mass-based processing-only provider is missing. Substituting the material market would double-count material supply. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | wire drawing, copper [RER]. Energy-only service proxy: assume 0.5 MJ German electricity per kg wire-drawing service. Original copper supply is counted separately and is not added again. Lubricants, tooling and drawing losses are not separately represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 6; source type: resource; original description: wire drawing, copper; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.1025; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-7> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A7:F7; source type=resource; description=diode, unspecified, at plant; location=GLO; amount=0.002812499999999999 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_ELMA; Same source geography. Broad electrical-machinery sector proxy; not a semiconductor-specific dataset. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 7; source type: resource; original description: diode, unspecified, at plant; original geography: GLO; original quantity: 0.002812499999999999; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-8> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A8:F8; source type=resource; description=silicone product, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.121875 kg; SD95=1.243456651079923. BONSAI M_RUBP_01_RES; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad finished plastic/rubber-products proxy; silicone chemistry or glass-fibre fraction and moulding are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 8; source type: resource; original description: silicone product, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.121875; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.243456651079923; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-panel-cn-9> dcterms:description "Excel X-Panel - CN!A9:F9; source type=resource; description=tin, at regional storage; location=RER; amount=0.012875 kg; SD95=1.34403163730924. BONSAI M_LZTP; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad lead/zinc/tin sector proxy; individual metal purity and production route are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Panel - CN; row: 9; source type: resource; original description: tin, at regional storage; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.012875; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.34403163730924; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
