<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-si-market-cn-7> dcterms:description "Excel X-Si-Market - CN!A7:F7; source type=resource; description=transport, transoceanic freight ship; location=OCE; amount=5.373944501363156 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, transoceanic freight ship [OCE]. Assume EUR 0.01 per t.km, expressed in the BONSAI monetary water-transport service. The global sector is a broad ocean-freight proxy. This price is an illustrative scenario value, not a current freight quote. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Si-Market - CN; row: 7; source type: resource; original description: transport, transoceanic freight ship; original geography: OCE; original quantity: 5.373944501363156; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-si-market-cn-8> dcterms:description "Excel X-Si-Market - CN!A8:F8; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, rail; location=RER; amount=0.2 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, rail [RER]. Assume EUR 0.03 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. This is not a rail-specific physical dataset. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Si-Market - CN; row: 8; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, rail; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.2; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-si-market-cn-9> dcterms:description "Excel X-Si-Market - CN!A9:F9; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=0.05 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Si-Market - CN; row: 9; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.05; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
