<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-apac-9> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - APAC!A9:F9; source type=resource; description=electricity, medium voltage, at grid; location=KR; amount=49 kWh; SD95=1.103058016036378. Quantity conversion: 1 kWh = 3.6 MJ. BONSAI M_electricity; Same source geography. National aggregate electricity market; voltage and grid-specific losses are not distinguished. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - APAC; row: 9; source type: resource; original description: electricity, medium voltage, at grid; original geography: KR; original quantity: 49; original unit: kWh; SD95: 1.103058016036378; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
