<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-cn-11> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - CN!A11:F11; source type=resource; description=silicone plant; location=RER; amount=1e-11 unit; SD95=3.05206411724486. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | silicone plant [RER]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. This is an arbitrary demonstration coefficient, not a measured plant cost; equipment and plant-specific construction are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - CN; row: 11; source type: resource; original description: silicone plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1e-11; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.05206411724486; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
