<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-us-4> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - US!A4:F4; source type=resource; description=hydrochloric acid, 30% in H2O, at plant; location=RER; amount=1.6016713091922 kg; SD95=1.249362470945516. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - US; row: 4; source type: resource; original description: hydrochloric acid, 30% in H2O, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 1.6016713091922; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.249362470945516; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
