<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-us-6> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - US!A6:F6; source type=resource; description=sodium hydroxide, 50% in H2O, production mix, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.3481894150417827 kg; SD95=1.249362470945516. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - US; row: 6; source type: resource; original description: sodium hydroxide, 50% in H2O, production mix, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.3481894150417827; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.249362470945516; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-us-7> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - US!A7:F7; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=2.868542246982358 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - US; row: 7; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 2.868542246982358; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-us-8> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - US!A8:F8; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, rail; location=RER; amount=3.65125348189415 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, rail [RER]. Assume EUR 0.03 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. This is not a rail-specific physical dataset. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - US; row: 8; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, rail; original geography: RER; original quantity: 3.65125348189415; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-sog-siemens-us-9> dcterms:description "Excel X-SoG-Siemens - US!A9:F9; source type=resource; description=electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant; location=RER; amount=13.79641827443997 kWh; SD95=1.103058016036378. Quantity conversion: 1 kWh = 3.6 MJ. BONSAI M_electricity; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad electricity-market proxy only; the source generation technology and exergy allocation are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-SoG-Siemens - US; row: 9; source type: resource; original description: electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 13.79641827443997; original unit: kWh; SD95: 1.103058016036378; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
