<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-10> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A10:F10; source type=resource; description=acrylic binder, 34% in H2O, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.002001150558842867 kg; SD95=1.21645941255843. BONSAI M_CHEM; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad chemicals-nec sector proxy, not an exact chemical production dataset. The full original input mass, including stated solution concentration, is retained; no active-substance or dilution adjustment is invented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 10; source type: resource; original description: acrylic binder, 34% in H2O, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.002001150558842867; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.21645941255843; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-11> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A11:F11; source type=resource; description=brass, at plant; location=CH; amount=0.007437541091387246 kg; SD95=1.21645941255843. BONSAI M_ONFM; Same source geography. Broad other non-ferrous-metals sector proxy; brass composition is not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 11; source type: resource; original description: brass, at plant; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.007437541091387246; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.21645941255843; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-12> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A12:F12; source type=resource; description=chromium steel 18/8, at plant; location=RER; amount=0.001510490916333472 kg; SD95=1.322985558407643. BONSAI M_STEL; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Broad iron/steel sector proxy; stainless-steel alloy chemistry is not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 12; source type: resource; original description: chromium steel 18/8, at plant; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.001510490916333472; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.322985558407643; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-13> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A13:F13; source type=resource; description=wire drawing, steel; location=RER; amount=0.008948032007720718 kg; SD95=1.322985558407643. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: A mass-based processing-only provider is missing. Substituting the material market would double-count material supply. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | wire drawing, steel [RER]. Energy-only service proxy: assume 1 MJ German electricity per kg wire-drawing service. Original steel supply is counted separately and is not added again. Lubricants, tooling and drawing losses are not separately represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 13; source type: resource; original description: wire drawing, steel; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.008948032007720718; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.322985558407643; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-14> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A14:F14; source type=resource; description=electricity, medium voltage, at grid; location=CN; amount=4.761904761904762 kWh; SD95=2.051815722425253. Quantity conversion: 1 kWh = 3.6 MJ. BONSAI M_electricity; Same source geography. National aggregate electricity market; voltage and grid-specific losses are not distinguished. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 14; source type: resource; original description: electricity, medium voltage, at grid; original geography: CN; original quantity: 4.761904761904762; original unit: kWh; SD95: 2.051815722425253; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-15> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A15:F15; source type=resource; description=natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; location=RER; amount=3.99819197896121 MJ; SD95=1.21645941255843. BONSAI EF_GASE; Geographic proxy: source RER represented by BONSAI DE; not an exact regional match. Natural-gas combustion proxy in energy units; furnace efficiency and low-NOx technology are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 15; source type: resource; original description: natural gas, burned in industrial furnace low-NOx >100kW; original geography: RER; original quantity: 3.99819197896121; original unit: MJ; SD95: 1.21645941255843; mapping status: BONSAI compatible physical provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-16> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A16:F16; source type=resource; description=water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant; location=CN; amount=55.55555555555556 kg; SD95=1.264452481673482. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant [CN]. Assume 1000 kg water/m3, EUR 2/m3 for water supply and 0.005 MJ electricity/kg for deionisation. Thus 1 kg requires EUR 0.002 water service and 0.005 MJ electricity. The German monetary water sector is a geographic proxy for Chinese water because the Chinese offering has no published provider URI; Chinese electricity is used. Resins, chemicals and treatment infrastructure are not separately modelled. These are illustrative coefficients, not plant data. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 16; source type: resource; original description: water, deionised, water balance according to MoeK 2013, at plant; original geography: CN; original quantity: 55.55555555555556; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.264452481673482; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-17> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A17:F17; source type=resource; description=disposal, waste, silicon wafer production, 0% water, to underground deposit; location=DE; amount=0.1101249178172255 kg; SD95=1.21645941255843. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The available water-supply provider is monetary. No verified mass-to-price conversion or deionisation process is supplied. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | disposal, waste, silicon wafer production, 0% water, to underground deposit [DE]. Assume German hazardous-waste landfill as a treatment proxy. This does not reproduce a dedicated underground-deposit technology and does not establish the actual hazard classification. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 17; source type: resource; original description: disposal, waste, silicon wafer production, 0% water, to underground deposit; original geography: DE; original quantity: 0.1101249178172255; original unit: kg; SD95: 1.21645941255843; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-18> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A18:F18; source type=resource; description=treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2; location=CH; amount=0.05 m3; SD95=1.264452481673482. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: The source is a volume-based effluent service; BONSAI uses mass service units. Effluent density and an agreed service match are missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2 [CH]. Assume effluent density 1000 kg/m3. One m3 requires treatment of 1000 kg in the Swiss sewage-service sector. Source treatment class and effluent composition are not represented. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 18; source type: resource; original description: treatment, sewage, to wastewater treatment, class 2; original geography: CH; original quantity: 0.05; original unit: m3; SD95: 1.264452481673482; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-19> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A19:F19; source type=resource; description=transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; location=RER; amount=0.2358669784614089 tkm; SD95=2.09499413010681. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No selectable BONSAI provider has a tkm reference unit. A verified transport price or energy conversion is missing. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | transport, freight, lorry, fleet average [RER]. Assume EUR 0.10 per t.km, expressed in the German monetary land-transport sector. Road freight is not isolated from other land transport in this sector. Price is illustrative, not a market quotation. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 19; source type: resource; original description: transport, freight, lorry, fleet average; original geography: RER; original quantity: 0.2358669784614089; original unit: tkm; SD95: 2.09499413010681; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
