<https://w3id.org/cerise-see/examples/pv-lci#flow-x-wafer-cn-21> dcterms:description "Excel X-Wafer - CN!A21:F21; source type=resource; description=wafer factory; location=DE; amount=0.00000399819197896121 unit; SD95=3.049209528962525. ORIGINAL BACKGROUND DATA GAP: No matching factory/pallet capital-good dataset with the required item basis has been identified. The external source URI is a workbook record, not a calculated supplier DPP; no zero-impact assumption is made. RESOLVED FOR DEMONSTRATION through SCENARIO PROXY | wafer factory [DE]. Illustrative allocation proxy: 1 factory-equivalent = EUR 1,000,000 of Belgian civil-engineering construction services. Not a measured factory cost or equipment inventory. Source evidence retained from the master inventory: sheet: X-Wafer - CN; row: 21; source type: resource; original description: wafer factory; original geography: DE; original quantity: 0.00000399819197896121; original unit: unit; SD95: 3.049209528962525; mapping status: resolved through explicit demonstration proxy. Source provenance identifies the supplying output exchange. The receiving input and supplying output are separate Flow instances. Supplier resolution follows the native declaring-dataset/FlowType path." .
